pwright-node-host contains a Rust adaptation of the glob conversion algorithm
from Playwright 1.58.2, lib/utils/isomorphic/urlMatch.js.
Modified by pwright contributors: Rust iterator-based compilation, explicit
resource admission, bounded storage and retained metadata lookup integration.
The adapted modules are src/frame_lookup/glob.rs and glob_base.rs, including
URL-glob preprocessing and legacy string replacement. No Playwright driver is bundled.

